Cell["\<\
This an old verification. Some isomorphisms may be wrong. Now we have package \
functions, which  makes search for isomorphism easy, see the last 2 \
subsections, Cl(3,0) explicit isomorphism to Cl(1,2) and \
gaTensorProduct[Cl[0, 2], Cl[2, 0]]->Cl[4, 0, 0]. All other subsections needs \
recalculation to adopt that function.\
\>", "Text",
